    "Assign symmetric tile columns cyclically, using padded atomic completion counters for ordered block handoffs.",
    "Accumulate forces in aligned O(n) scratch, then update velocities after a team barrier.",
    "Use static row work sharing when the tile wavefront is too narrow, coordinates are nonfinite, or scratch allocation fails."
  ]
